<p style="text-align:left"><span style="font-size:16.0px;color:#E6E6E6">  currency</span><span style="font-size:16.0px;color:#E6E6E6">: </span><span style="font-size:16.0px;color:#9DD8A2">&quot;INR&quot;</span><span style="font-size:16.0px;color:#E6E6E6">,</span></p>
