<div class="slide__text" style="position:absolute;left:86.25%;top:94.67%;width:10.5%;height:4.0%;"><p style="text-align:right"><span style="font-size:13.33px;color:#555555">21 / 22</span></p></div>
<div class="slide__shape" style="position:absolute;left:4.5%;top:24.67%;width:30.3%;height:66.67%;background:#FFFFFF;border-radius:6px;"></div>
<div class="slide__shape" style="position:absolute;left:4.5%;top:24.67%;width:30.3%;height:1.33%;background:#1A355E;border-radius:6px;"></div>
<div class="slide__text" style="position:absolute;left:6.38%;top:27.33%;width:26.55%;height:6.67%;"><p style="text-align:left"><span style="font-size:23.99px;color:#1A355E"><strong>Engineering</strong></span></p></div>
<div class="slide__text" style="position:absolute;left:6.38%;top:34.67%;width:26.55%;height:56.0%;"><p style="text-align:left"><span style="font-size:16.0px;color:#3A3A3A">•  Strict-mode TypeScript across server + lib.</span></p>
<p style="text-align:left"><span style="font-size:16.0px;color:#3A3A3A">•  Native-cloud first: Cloud Run, Secret Manager, Artifact Registry, Cloud Logging.</span></p>
<p style="text-align:left"><span style="font-size:16.0px;color:#3A3A3A">•  Protocol design: Beckn / ONDC contract rather than ad-hoc API.</span></p>
<p style="text-align:left"><span style="font-size:16.0px;color:#3A3A3A">•  WCAG 2.2 AAA as a build constraint, not an afterthought.</span></p>
<p style="text-align:left"><span style="font-size:16.0px;color:#3A3A3A">•  Observability: structured logs + audit trail + SIEM dashboard.</span></p></div>
<div class="slide__shape" style="position:absolute;left:36.0%;top:24.67%;width:30.3%;height:66.67%;background:#FFFFFF;border-radius:6px;"></div>
<div class="slide__shape" style="position:absolute;left:36.0%;top:24.67%;width:30.3%;height:1.33%;background:#E26A2C;border-radius:6px;"></div>
<div class="slide__text" style="position:absolute;left:37.88%;top:27.33%;width:26.55%;height:6.67%;"><p style="text-align:left"><span style="font-size:23.99px;color:#E26A2C"><strong>Process</strong></span></p></div>
<div class="slide__text" style="position:absolute;left:37.88%;top:34.67%;width:26.55%;height:56.0%;"><p style="text-align:left"><span style="font-size:16.0px;color:#3A3A3A">•  Spec-first: SPEC.md drove every contract and table.</span></p>
<p style="text-align:left"><span style="font-size:16.0px;color:#3A3A3A">•  Agent-coordinated parallel workstreams kept progress unblocked.</span></p>
<p style="text-align:left"><span style="font-size:16.0px;color:#3A3A3A">•  Ephemeral-first MVP: no infra to manage during the build.</span></p>
<p style="text-align:left"><span style="font-size:16.0px;color:#3A3A3A">•  Deploy script idempotent from day one  —  re-run is the workflow.</span></p>
<p style="text-align:left"><span style="font-size:16.0px;color:#3A3A3A">•  Smoke suite as the safety net while iterating fast.</span></p></div>
<div class="slide__shape" style="position:absolute;left:67.5%;top:24.67%;width:30.3%;height:66.67%;background:#FFFFFF;border-radius:6px;"></div>
<div class="slide__shape" style="position:absolute;left:67.5%;top:24.67%;width:30.3%;height:1.33%;background:#1F7A3D;border-radius:6px;"></div>
<div class="slide__text" style="position:absolute;left:69.38%;top:27.33%;width:26.55%;height:6.67%;"><p style="text-align:left"><span style="font-size:23.99px;color:#1F7A3D"><strong>Personal</strong></span></p></div>
<div class="slide__text" style="position:absolute;left:69.38%;top:34.67%;width:26.55%;height:56.0%;"><p style="text-align:left"><span style="font-size:16.0px;color:#3A3A3A">•  Shipping &gt; perfection.  A working slow phone trumps a beautiful demo.</span></p>
<p style="text-align:left"><span style="font-size:16.0px;color:#3A3A3A">•  Reading other people&#x27;s APIs (Razorpay, ONDC, DigiLocker) is half the job.</span></p>
<p style="text-align:left"><span style="font-size:16.0px;color:#3A3A3A">•  Real users are not me: i18n + accessibility from day zero.</span></p>
<p style="text-align:left"><span style="font-size:16.0px;color:#3A3A3A">•  Document why, not what  —  README is the artefact reviewers actually read.</span></p>
<p style="text-align:left"><span style="font-size:16.0px;color:#3A3A3A">•  A capstone is an opening move, not a closing one.</span></p></div>
</section>
